OL,3,GNEWSASewage spills not recorded on
OL,4,Atime, report claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners claim South West Water
OL,7,Ffailed to report more than 3,000 sewage
OL,8,Fdischarges within the legally required
OL,9,Ftime of an hour, in the first half of
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FIn its annual report into water quality
OL,13,FSurfers Against Sewage said the water
OL,14,Ffirm's sewage spills during dry weather
OL,15,Flast more than 12,000 hours.
OL,17,FThe conservation charity also said
OL,18,Fbetween January and August, 625 people
OL,19,Freported being unwell after using
OL,20,Frivers, lakes and beaches in the South
OL,21,FWest on its app.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
