OL,3,GNEWSASewage spills not recorded on
OL,4,Atime, report claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe water company said it was reviewing
OL,7,Fthe methodology behind its sewage
OL,8,Fdischarge figures, adding: "There may
OL,9,Fbe differences in how the data has been
OL,10,Finterpreted." It added it treated all
OL,11,Fillness reports seriously.
